  "prefLabel": "Ncr 212.04 Evidence",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 212.04 Evidence.\n\n(a) Receipt of evidence shall be governed by the provisions of RSA 541-A:33.\n\n(b) All relevant, material evidence shall be admissible.\n\n(c) The presiding officer, shall exclude evidence which is irrelevant, immaterial, or unduly repetitious.\n\nSource. #14254, INTERIM, eff 5-23-25; ss by #14447, eff 12-4-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr200.html"
